WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:127826

1
00:00:00.567 --> 00:00:03.970
In this course, you learned about agentic document processing,

2
00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:06.973
enabling you to parse and extract information

3
00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:08.775
from files like PDFs.

4
00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:12.779
You explored how to convert images to text through OCR,

5
00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:15.482
analyze layout with bounding boxes,

6
00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:18.485
and logically order recognizable chunks.

7
00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:22.489
You also employed VLMs to understand text in context.

8
00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:27.961
Using ADE, a vision-first agentic approach to document understanding,

9
00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:31.664
you processed complex documents and built a RAG application

10
00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:34.667
for answering questions about unstructured files.

11
00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:37.470
Finally, you explored moving your application

12
00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:39.973
to the cloud and making it event-driven.

13
00:00:40.673 --> 00:00:43.343
I'm looking forward to seeing what you'll build on your own.
